{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "documentation": "DATA.md",
  "path_base": "catalog_directory",
  "join_key": "run_id",
  "csv_empty_value": null,
  "phase_index_base": 0,
  "categories": {
    "comparisons": "方法与基线对照",
    "return-ablations": "回访与阶段干预消融",
    "parameter-ablations": "超参数与组件消融",
    "diagnostics": "机制诊断",
    "behavioral-analysis": "策略行为分析"
  },
  "datasets": {
    "runs": {
      "key": ["run_id"],
      "config_path_base": "runs_csv_directory",
      "parent_reference": "parent_run_id",
      "commit_field": "commit",
      "step_unit": "environment_steps"
    },
    "evaluations": {
      "key": ["run_id", "phase", "task", "label", "t_env"],
      "win_rate_numerator": "wins",
      "win_rate_denominator": "episodes",
      "step_field": "t_env",
      "labels": {
        "initial_reference": "初始模型评估",
        "next_unseen": "首次训练目标任务前评估",
        "phase_start": "本阶段开始时评估当前任务",
        "periodic": "本阶段定期评估当前任务",
        "stage_end": "阶段末评估已见任务"
      }
    },
    "stage_metrics": {
      "key": ["run_id", "phase"],
      "derived_from": "evaluations",
      "units": {
        "*_win_pct": "percent",
        "acc_pct": "percent",
        "bwt_pp": "percentage_points",
        "fwt_pp": "percentage_points",
        "return_auc_pct": "percent"
      }
    },
    "preference_diagnostics": {
      "key": ["run_id", "phase", "source_phase", "historical_task"],
      "coverage_numerator": "valid_states",
      "coverage_denominator": "decision_states",
      "sampling_unit": "replayed agent decisions with repeated samples"
    }
  },
  "experiments": [
    {
      "id": "szc-vdn64",
      "category": "comparisons",
      "report": "comparisons/szc-vdn64/README.md",
      "files": {
        "runs": "comparisons/szc-vdn64/runs.csv",
        "stage_metrics": "comparisons/szc-vdn64/stage_metrics.csv",
        "evaluations": "comparisons/szc-vdn64/evaluations.csv",
        "preference_diagnostics": "comparisons/szc-vdn64/preference_diagnostics.csv",
        "chi_selection": "comparisons/szc-vdn64/chi_selection.json"
      },
      "task_order": ["stalker", "zealot", "colossus"],
      "training_seeds": [3535, 2222],
      "final_phase": 2,
      "comparison": {
        "kind": "independent_runs_matched_by_seed",
        "match_on": ["seed"],
        "primary_control": {"method": "VDN-FT", "role": "independent"},
        "additional_control": {"method": "VDN-ER", "role": "independent"}
      },
      "interpretation_limits": [
        "只覆盖一个任务顺序、双层 VDN64 和两个训练种子。评估局数用于估计单次运行的表现。",
        "VDN-ER 使用按任务平衡的 TD 经验回放，VDN-FT 与干预组采用逐阶段清空或重建 TD 回放。所有组按任务重启 ε。",
        "CHI 与 VDN-FT 使用不同驱动。定期评估相对阶段起点的对齐规则不同，曲线对齐应使用实际 t_env。",
        "FRPR-ReLU、T1PR-Max 与 T1PR-Unfiltered 和原版的比较同时包含历史轨迹旧 Q 记录的版本变化。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ts4-vdn64-ranking",
      "category": "return-ablations",
      "report": "return-ablations/ts4-vdn64-ranking/README.md",
      "files": {
        "runs": "return-ablations/ts4-vdn64-ranking/runs.csv",
        "stage_metrics": "return-ablations/ts4-vdn64-ranking/stage_metrics.csv",
        "evaluations": "return-ablations/ts4-vdn64-ranking/evaluations.csv",
        "preference_diagnostics": "return-ablations/ts4-vdn64-ranking/preference_diagnostics.csv"
      },
      "task_order": ["stalker", "zealot", "colossus", "stalker"],
      "training_seeds": [3535],
      "final_phase": 3,
      "comparison": {
        "kind": "paired_branches",
        "match_on": ["method", "seed", "parent_run_id"],
        "treatment": {"role": "keep"},
        "primary_control": {"role": "release"},
        "independent_reference": {"method": "VDN-FT", "role": "independent"}
      },
      "interpretation_limits": [
        "只有 seed 3535。FRPR 和 T1PR 各自以其 C 末父运行作为共同起点，跨方法 C 末状态不同。",
        "独立 VDN-FT 的 C 末状态和源码提交与偏好分支不同，它提供从头训练的参考。",
        "A₂ 再访 stalker 沿用同一任务 ID。分支只存新增阶段，重算时沿 parent_run_id 找前三阶段；A₂ 的 32 局定期评估与 128 局阶段末评估都进入报告的 AUC。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "szc-vdn64-tkpr-k",
      "category": "parameter-ablations",
      "report": "parameter-ablations/szc-vdn64-tkpr-k/README.md",
      "files": {
        "runs": "parameter-ablations/szc-vdn64-tkpr-k/runs.csv",
        "stage_metrics": "parameter-ablations/szc-vdn64-tkpr-k/stage_metrics.csv",
        "evaluations": "parameter-ablations/szc-vdn64-tkpr-k/evaluations.csv",
        "preference_diagnostics": "parameter-ablations/szc-vdn64-tkpr-k/preference_diagnostics.csv",
        "mechanism_summary": "parameter-ablations/szc-vdn64-tkpr-k/mechanism_summary.json"
      },
      "task_order": [
        "stalker",
        "zealot",
        "colossus"
      ],
      "training_seeds": [
        1111
      ],
      "final_phase": 2,
      "comparison": {
        "kind": "independent_runs_matched_by_seed",
        "match_on": [
          "seed"
        ],
        "primary_control": {
          "method": "FRPR",
          "role": "independent"
        }
      },
      "interpretation_limits": [
        "只覆盖 seed 1111 和 SZC 任务顺序。五条独立运行在 S 末的 Agent 参数指纹一致。",
        "有效 K 分布按参与排序约束的回放决策汇总，包含重复采样。",
        "梯度每 100 次更新抽样一次，汇总无法单独确定性能差异的成因。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement",
      "category": "behavioral-analysis",
      "report": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/README.md",
      "files": {
        "summary": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/summary.csv",
        "per_episode": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/per_episode.csv",
        "confidence": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/confidence.csv",
        "per_agent": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/per_agent.csv",
        "correlation": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/correlation.csv",
        "manifest": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/manifest.json",
        "rollout_audit": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement/rollout_audit.json"
      },
      "task_order": [
        "stalker",
        "zealot",
        "colossus"
      ],
      "training_seeds": [
        1111,
        2222,
        3535
      ],
      "comparison": {
        "kind": "frozen_policy_replay",
        "key": [
          "comparison_id"
        ],
        "match_on": [
          "task",
          "reference",
          "stage"
        ],
        "primary_cohort": "k_ablation",
        "additional_cohort": "earlier_frpr"
      },
      "interpretation_limits": [
        "同批 K1/K2/K3/K5/FRPR 只覆盖 seed 1111。其他两条 FRPR 使用较早版本。",
        "每行 AGR 来自旧策略访问的状态。Z 自身阶段参考因方法而异，统一参考使用独立 Z 模型。",
        "相关性以运行端点为单位，分任务、阶段与参考策略计算，属于小样本描述统计。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "szc-vdn64-action-regret",
      "category": "behavioral-analysis",
      "report": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-action-regret/README.md",
      "files": {
        "summary": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-action-regret/summary.csv",
        "per_episode": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-action-regret/per_episode.csv",
        "confidence": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-action-regret/confidence.csv",
        "per_agent": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-action-regret/per_agent.csv",
        "audit": "behavioral-analysis/szc-vdn64-action-regret/audit.json"
      },
      "task_order": [
        "stalker",
        "zealot",
        "colossus"
      ],
      "training_seeds": [
        1111,
        2222,
        3535
      ],
      "comparison": {
        "kind": "frozen_policy_replay",
        "source_experiment": "szc-vdn64-greedy-action-agreement",
        "key": [
          "comparison_id"
        ],
        "match_on": [
          "task",
          "reference",
          "stage"
        ],
        "primary_cohort": "k_ablation",
        "additional_cohort": "earlier_frpr"
      },
      "interpretation_limits": [
        "R 是旧策略估计的动作价值损失，由旧 Agent 的合法动作 Q 值计算。",
        "同批方法比较只有 seed 1111。其他两个 FRPR 端点使用较早训练实现。",
        "Z 自身参考的轨迹随方法变化，统一 Z 参考复用同一批独立策略轨迹。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
